      "expected negation_count >= 3 (couldn't, wouldn't, not)\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "raw = \"I couldn't sleep and I wouldn't go out. I am not hopeless. I am sad.\"\n",
    "print(raw)\n",
    "print(\"negation ratio (presentation marker):\", negation_ratio(raw))\n",
    "print(\"lexicons (hopeless skipped after not; sad counted):\", lexicon_counts(raw))\n",
    "print(\"expected negation_count >= 3 (couldn't, wouldn't, not)\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "32a3046e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. What this notebook does not recompute\n",
    "\n",
    "Whisper, F0, and the licensed lexicons are not rerun here. Acoustic features are extracted only after the gates above.\n",
    "\n",
    "The actigraphy contrastive model is in `01_actigraphy_relapse_model.ipynb`. Speech markers were analysed separately; this tutorial does not train a joint multimodal classifier.\n",
    "\n",
   ]
  }
